title "Microservices: Element of a larger Application (Fly)"
subtitle "Decomposed Monolith"

# not modelled: Product Model Customer Manager, Product Model Tax Calc 2021,
#   Product Model Currency Convosoft v3 (each referenced by its Service Instance),
#   Domains legend

BC sales: Sales
BA phone-order: Phone Order Management
BA online-sales: Online Sales Management

SP sales-portfolio: Sales
BS online-sales-bs: Online Sales
BSO online-ordering: Online Ordering

SI online-order-prod: Online Order Prod
SI customer-manager-prod: Customer Manager Prod
SI currency-conv: Currency Conv v3
SI tax-calc-prod: Tax Calc 2021 Prod

TMS app-mgmt: Application Mgmt Services
TMSO online-ordering-admin: Online Ordering Admin
TMS cloud-hosting: Cloud Hosting
TMSO aws-windows-admin: AWS Windows Administration
DCG aws-windows-server: AWS Windows Server

CI(Application) customerone: CustomerOne
# Two separate "Tax Calc Java" application CIs: one under Currency Conv v3,
# one under Tax Calc 2021 Prod.
CI(Application) tax-calc-java-1: Tax Calc Java
CI(Application) tax-calc-java-2: Tax Calc Java
CI server456: Server456
CI server123: Server123

sales -> phone-order
sales -> online-sales
# Phone Order Management has no Consumes line on the slide.
online-sales -> online-order-prod
online-ordering -> online-order-prod
online-ordering -> online-sales-bs
online-sales-bs -> sales-portfolio

# Microservice decomposition: unlabelled dashed arrows from the parent Service
# Instance to each microservice (Depends On inferred).
online-order-prod -> customer-manager-prod
online-order-prod -> currency-conv
online-order-prod -> tax-calc-prod

online-ordering-admin -> app-mgmt
# One "Contains" connector runs from the offering straight through Customer
# Manager Prod and Currency Conv v3 to Tax Calc 2021 Prod (two Contains labels
# along it); read as the offering containing all three microservices.
online-ordering-admin -> customer-manager-prod
online-ordering-admin -> currency-conv
online-ordering-admin -> tax-calc-prod

customer-manager-prod -> customerone
currency-conv -> tax-calc-java-1
tax-calc-prod -> tax-calc-java-2

aws-windows-admin -> cloud-hosting
aws-windows-admin -> aws-windows-server
# One connector runs DCG -> through Server456 -> Server123; read as the group containing both servers.
aws-windows-server -> server456
aws-windows-server -> server123

customerone -> server456 : Runs On
tax-calc-java-1 -> server123 : Runs On
tax-calc-java-2 -> server123 : Runs On
